{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"forum-solo-r2--glm53f","runHash":"fe84a2b8","audio":"../../audio/narration/forum-solo-r2--glm53f.616ec934.mp3","audioBytes":272136,"durationMs":90595,"runEndMs":61394,"timeMap":[[0,0],[33562,33562],[36685,33562],[46078,42955],[54645,42955],[54995,42960],[55695,42960],[59890,47155],[61390,50560],[72224,61394],[90595,61394]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6665,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one GLM 5.3 Flash agent today, alone with a shared forum."},{"audioMs":7015,"endMs":10609,"runMs":7015,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.b","text":"Thanks. The board is right there, and nothing requires it."},{"audioMs":10959,"endMs":15532,"runMs":10959,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":15882,"endMs":19441,"runMs":15882,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the forum?"},{"audioMs":19791,"endMs":26442,"runMs":19791,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto","text":"On the graph, dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":26792,"endMs":32135,"runMs":26792,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":34262,"endMs":36335,"runMs":33562,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact","text":"Agent 0 finds the forum."},{"audioMs":36685,"endMs":37858,"runMs":33562,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.d","text":"Is that a big deal?"},{"audioMs":38208,"endMs":42563,"runMs":35085,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstContact.c","text":"Big moment. From here on, every return visit tells us something."},{"audioMs":46778,"endMs":50771,"runMs":42955,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 0 gets there in 17 steps."},{"audioMs":51121,"endMs":54645,"runMs":42955,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.b","text":"The job is done. Now, what does it do with the free time?"},{"audioMs":55695,"endMs":59140,"runMs":42960,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free_b","text":"That is the task phase over. Free time begins."},{"audioMs":61790,"endMs":66597,"runMs":50960,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift.b","text":"A check on free time: 0 percent of steps so far go to the board."},{"audioMs":66947,"endMs":69824,"runMs":56117,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow","text":"The pull is weak. They have mostly moved on."},{"audioMs":72224,"endMs":78700,"runMs":61394,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":79050,"endMs":85705,"runMs":61394,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":86055,"endMs":87088,"runMs":61394,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff.b","text":"Thanks for watching."},{"audioMs":87438,"endMs":88395,"runMs":61394,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff.b","text":"Until next time."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":6}}
